    {
      "id": 5662,
      "title": "A Tribute to Women of Rock",
      "url": "https://www.bethesda.org/event/a-tribute-to-women-of-rock-2/",
      "description": "<p>For the third consecutive year,\u00a0<strong>Rockin&#8217; Rona Entertainment\u00a0</strong>is proud to bring back the electrifying concert <strong>A Tribute to Women of Rock</strong>! Produced by the incomparable\u00a0<strong>Patty Reese</strong>, this powerhouse production has had overflow crowds and received rave reviews two years in a row and is ready to raise the roof once again with an all-star lineup of incredible female vocalists and talented musicians.</p>\n<p>Featuring unforgettable performances by\u00a0<strong>Patty Reese, Heather Lloyd, Mama Moon, Annie Sidley, Jen Smith, Kai Martin, Juliette Lloyd, Michelle Renee Dupwe, Elena Martin, Caz Gardiner, Anita King, and Gina Cocco</strong>, backed by an outstanding band featuring\u00a0<strong>Jonathan Sloane, Eric Scott, Steve Sidley, Deren Blessman, and Justin Gilles</strong>. Together, they&#8217;ll bring to life some of the greatest songs ever recorded by the most iconic women of rock.</p>",
